            "summary": "Brown & Brown (BRO) delivered 17% annualized earnings growth over the past five years, and current forecasts call for an even sharper pace, at 18.2% per year. This is ahead of the broader US market\u2019s 15.6%. Revenue is expected to rise by 17.2% per year, easily topping the US market average of 10.1%. However, net profit margin has slipped to 18.3% from last year\u2019s 22.8%. While high-quality earnings continue to be recognized, negative growth in the past year adds a note of caution for investors...",
